@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Green Rides

[*] --> DisplayJourneyDetails : user login and destination selection

state "Display journey details" as DisplayJourneyDetails
state "Activate driving mode or choose other options" as ActivateDrivingMode
state "Select a place to eat, view its menu, and place an order" as SelectPlaceToEat
state "Inform relevant authorities in the event of an accident" as InformAuthorities
state "Send notifications during driving or in case of an accident" as SendNotifications
state "Allow users to provide feedback upon completion of their journey" as ProvideFeedback

DisplayJourneyDetails --> ActivateDrivingMode : viewing journey details
ActivateDrivingMode --> SelectPlaceToEat : user chooses other options
SelectPlaceToEat --> InformAuthorities : user places order
InformAuthorities --> SendNotifications : accident occurs
SendNotifications --> ProvideFeedback : driving or accident notification
ProvideFeedback --> [*] : feedback provided

@enduml
